3. e5 {[%course black] Advance Variation} (3. exd5 exd5 {[%course black] Exchange Variation}) (3. Nc3 dxe4 {[%course black] Rubinstein Variation} (3... Bb4 {Winawer Variation}) (3... Nf6 {Classical Variation})) (3. Nd2 dxe4 {[%course black] Rubinstein Variation} (3... c5 {Tarrasch: 3...c5}))
